    // Egg festival
    "abby-pre-egg-hunt.unfriendly": "You ready for the egg hunt? I always win, and this year won't be any different.",
    "abby-pre-egg-hunt.0": "@, you think I'm getting too old to participate in the egg hunt?",
    "abby-pre-egg-hunt.1": "Mum says I shouldn't be so competitive against Vince and Jas fur the egg hunt. She says I should let them win at least some of the time.#$b#@, what do you think?",
    "abby-pre-egg-hunt.2": "I'm training hard for the egg hunt this year! Getting all sorts of training tips from Alex",
    "abby-pre-egg-hunt.3": "Gosh, @, it must be so easy for you to stay so fit, running around all day like that.#$b#You're not stuck in front of a screen taking online classes all day.",
    "abby-pre-egg-hunt.4": "I wish dad would let me train up as an adventurer, but he wants me to go get my degree.#$b#I wonder if he wants me to get a Mrs. Degree.",
    "abby-y2-egg-spouse": "We might be married but I'm still better at egg hunt than you are.",
    "abby-y3-egg.00": "Abigail looks like she's concentrating very deeply.",
    "abby-y3-egg.01": "Go away, I'm focusing for the egg hunt.",
    "alex-y3-egg.00": "Abby actually asked me to help her train for the egg hunt this year.",
    "alex-y3-egg.01": "She'll be a formidable foe.",
    "alex-y2-egg-spouse": "I'm definitely gonna get enough protein today!",
    "caroline-y3-egg.00": "I was pretty good at the egg hunt when I was a kid too.",
    "caroline-y3-egg.01": "Of course, I haven't competed since college.",
    "clint-y3-egg.00": "Yuck, warm egg salad.",
    "demetrius-y3-egg.00": "I was just talking to Doc Harvey over here about a recent paper from %place.",
    "demetrius-y3-egg.01": "Even fifteen minutes of being outside each day does wonders for your health.",
    "elliott-y3-egg.00": "I do greatly enjoy events like this.",
    "elliott-y3-egg.01": "Since antiquity, humanity has gathered to celebrate the return of spring!",
    "elliott-y2-egg-spouse": "I'm just going to help myself to a little more of Gus's cooking...",
    "emily-y3-egg.00": "Ah, winter's gone, and the valley's all colorful again!",
    "emily-y3-egg.01": "It's so much easier to be cheery when your surroundings are not so drab and gray.",
    "emily-y1-egg-spouse": "I've been helping Gus prepare this feast for days! It's always nice to see your hard work pay off!",
    "emily-y2-egg-spouse": "Hopefully all the eggs are found, otherwise they'll start to smell.",
    "evelyn-y3-egg.00": "Come here darling, relax and enjoy yourself.",
    "evelyn-y3-egg.01": "You've got your spring planting done, right? Time to take a break.",
    "george-y3-egg.00": "Evelyn forced me to attend.",
    "george-y3-egg.01": "She says I need to get more fresh air, or something like that. Hrmph.",
    "gus-y3-egg.00": "Marnie's hens were working overtime to get all these good, fresh eggs!",
    "gus-y3-egg.01": "Good ingredients make it so much easier to make good food!",
    "haley-y3-egg.00": "Emily used to be really good at the egg hunt when we were young.",
    "haley-y3-egg.01": "She and Alex gave everyone a run for their money.",
    "haley-y2-egg-spouse": "Just catching up with Alex a bit. Will catch up with Emily a bit later.",
    "harvey-y3-egg.00": "How long has this egg salad been sitting out?",
    "harvey-y3-egg.01": "I guess I should trust that Gus knows what he's doing...",
    "harvey-y2-egg-spouse": "Just chatting a bit with Demetrius, he's filling me in on all the interesting papers he's seen lately.",
    "harvey-y3-egg-spouse": "Looking forward to all the different ways Gus prepared eggs this year!",
    "jas-y3-egg": "This year...this year will be my year, I can feel it!",
    "jodi-y3-egg": "I think Kent's slowly coming back to us now. Well, at least I have to hope.",
    "kent-y2-egg-return": "Gosh, I'm not used to this anymore.",
    "kent-y2-egg": "Vincent seems to be enjoying himself. I'm glad for that.",
    "kent-y3-egg": "This festival can be quite chaotic.",
    "leah-y3-egg.00": "Gus's egg salad is really excellent this year!",
    "leah-y3-egg.01": "Of course, everything Gus makes is amazing!",
    "leah-y2-egg-spouse": "I really should catch up with Elliott more often, shouldn't I?",
    "leah-y3-egg-spouse": "You go have fun with the egg hunt, I'll go chat a bit with Robin later if she has time.",
    "leo-y2-egg": "Using real eggs for an egg hunt is a little weird, isn't it?",
    "lewis-y2-egg": "It always amazes me how many new egg dishes Gus can come up with each year.",
    "lewis-y3-egg.00": "The children usually like the egg hunt.",
    "lewis-y3-egg.01": "Of course, some adults enjoy the hunt too!",
    "linus-y3-egg": "The egg salad looks wonderful this year. Gus always makes the best food.",
    "linus-y4-egg.00": "Ah, our lovely spring has returned!",
    "linus-y4-egg.01": "Many cultures celebrate the return of spring. I'm glad this is ours.",
    "marlon-y3-egg": "This warm weather is certainly nicer on my leg.",
    "marlon-y4-egg.00": "Kent here was just telling me about some things he saw in that war.",
    "marlon-y4-egg.01": "Makes even the depths of the mines seem tame.",
    "marnie-y3-egg": "This is my favorite festival. Spring's here, the chickens are outside and happy, and the eggs they produce are wonderful!",
    "marnie-y4-egg.00": "Gosh, I wonder what Gus cooked up this year?",
    "marnie-y4-egg.01": "Well, whatever it is, it'll be tasty!",
    "maru-y3-egg.00": "I wonder how many egg hunts I've participated in already?",
    "maru-y3-egg.01": "Sooner or later I guess I'll age out of it. But not this year!",
    "maru-y2-egg-spouse": "Gosh, it's nice to be able to catch up with the whole town at once, isn't it?",
    "maru-y3-egg-spouse": "Anything on the banquet table catch your eye? Personally, I'm looking forward to more of that egg salad.",
    "penny-y2-egg-spouse": "*sigh*, I really should do a better job of trying to keep in touch with Maru. It's so easy to become wrapped up in farm life...",
    "penny-y3-egg-spouse.00": "Oh, I used to love the egg salad my grandmother made...",
    "penny-y3-egg-spouse.01": "Sorry, @, I couldn't help but be reminded of her.",
    "pierre-y3-egg": "I don't think there are any eggs back here. So there's no reason for you to be here.", // there should be an egg back there, btw.
    "pierre-y4-egg.00": "Look, I don't know why you want to come back here, but can you please stay out of my way?",
    "pierre-y4-egg.01": "Festivals like this make up a good portion of our yearly earnings, so I do need to focus.",
    "robin-y3-egg": "That egg hunt does look kinda fun. If only I was a kid again...",
    "robin-y4-egg.00": "Heya, @, you've been in this valley for quite a while now, haven't you?",
    "robin-y4-egg.01": "Got any buildings you'd like me to build in this new year?",
    "sam-y2-egg": "Gosh, I remember, when I was Vince's age I'd be looking forward to summer break right around now...",
    "sam-y3-egg.00": "As lovely as it is to have warm weather again, my allergies certainly don't appreciate it.",
    "sam-y3-egg.01": "Did I forget to take my allergy meds this morning?",
    "sam-y2-egg-spouse": "Man, this reminds me, we need to get the band together for practice more often.",
    "shane-y3-egg.00": "There's really nothing like a farm fresh egg, isn't there?",
    "shane-y3-egg.01": "Some days I'm really glad I get to live in a place like this.",
    "shane-y1-egg-spouse": "Woke up early today to help Marnie with the chickens for the festival. Worth it, though, to see everyone so happy.",
    "shane-y2-egg-spouse.00": "You know, @, maybe we should contribute some eggs next year.",
    "shane-y2-egg-spouse.01": "Marnie usually handles this, but she's getting up there in age and maybe we should take a bit of the burden.",
    "vincent-y3-egg": "I'm gonna win the egg hunt this year!",
    "vincent-y4-egg.00": "It's unfair you and Abby get to play too.",
    "vincent-y4-egg.01": "You're so much bigger than Jas and me!",
    "willy-y3-egg": "I'm not used to so much egg. I'd rather have some nice salted cod...",
    "willy-y4-egg.00": "Weather like this just makes me want to set sail and fish.",
    "willy-y4-egg.01": "Spend the day out on them waters, see what I can catch...",

    // Flower Dance
    "abby-pre-dance.unfriendly": "Dad's all panicked about getting his booth ready for the dance. He's probably going to ask me to help him, if he spots me.",
    "abby-pre-dance.1": "Mom's making me get a new dress for this dance. Such a waste of money, I'd rather have a new video game.",
    "abby-pre-dance.2": "Mom wants me to get my hair cut and curled before the dance...$s",
    "abby-pre-dance.3": "You know, @, maybe I should conveniently get the flu. That'll get me out of the dance, right?",
    "abby-pre-dance.4": "Maybe mom should go dance in that dance instead of making me do it...",
    "abby-pre-dance.0": "Mom got me new shoes for the dance. They hurt my feet.",
    "abby-y2-dance.00": "@, you think we could get rid of this festival? I don't think anyone likes the dance.",
    "abby-y3-dance.00": "I really wouldn't dance if my dad didn't make me, but he thinks we should try harder to be part of the community.",
    "abby-y1-dance-spouse": "Ugh, @, dance with me? That way I won't feel so awkward.",
    "abby-y2-dance-spouse": "I wish dad didn't expect me to participate in this dance, especially now that I'm married.",
    "abby-dance-spouse-accept": "I guess we have to dance, don't we? Sure. Let's get this over with.",
    "alex-y2-dance.00": "Everyone looks fantastic today.",
    "alex-y1-dance-spouse": "You look great as always, my love. Dance with me?",
    "alex-y2-dance-spouse": "Wanna dance? Or do you want to just get out of here?",
    "caroline-y2-dance.00": "Maybe this year I'll get Pierre to dance with me...",
    "caroline-y3-dance.00": "I remember doing this dance, too, when I was young.",
    "caroline-y3-dance.01": "Only danced for a few years before I left for college, though.",
    "caroline-y2-abby-taken": "I wonder if Abby will feel better about dancing in the festival this year?",
    "clint-dance-no-emily": "Gosh, @, I've never been brave enough to ask someone to dance with me.",
    "clint-y2-dance": "I've been practicing this with my therapist, but now I'm not sure I can go through with asking someone to dance with me...",
    "clint-y3-dance": "I wonder if that refreshments table has any food on it still.",
    "demetrius-y2-dance": "Neither Robin nor I grew up here, so neither of us had to get up there and dance when we were young.",
    "demetrius-y3-dance": "I used to take Robin out for dances all the time, when we were young.",
    "demetrius-y3-dance-b": "Dancing is enjoyable enough, but in front of everyone?",
    "demetrius-y4-dance": "You can tell which type of pollinator a flower is trying to attract by just looking at the shape and color. Bee-pollinated flowers, for example, are usually bright blue or yellow.",
    "elliott-y2-dance.00": "I do enjoy a good dance every now and then.",
    "elliott-y2-dance.01": "Perhaps we should organize dances more often?",
    "elliott-y1-dance-spouse": "You look wonderful, my dear. Care to join me for a dance?",
    "emily-y2-dance.00": "I made my flower dance dress this year!",
    "emily-y2-dance.01": "Of course, I also made Haley's. What do you think?",
    "emily-y1-dance-spouse": "Gus and I have been working on the food for days! Isn't it amazing?",
    "emily-y2-dance-spouse": "I do enjoy a good opportunity to wear a beautiful dress. My @, will you dance with me today?",
    "evelyn-y2-dance": "Our little town used to be famous for its flowers. Used to be our biggest export.",
    "evelyn-y3-dance": "I do really enjoy putting together the flower arrangements every year. Aren't these lovely?",
    "evelyn-y4-dance": "I remember many years ago, when Pam and Caroline and Marnie were the ones dancing...Pam used to be quite good looking in her youth, you know.",
    "george-y2-dance": "Hrmph. Evelyn loves these flowers but they're horrid for my allergies...",
    "george-y3-dance": "Pushing my wheelchair across that tiny bridge wasn't easy, let me tell you that....and I still have to go back...",
    "george-y4-dance": "Gosh, @, I wish I could still take my dear Evelyn out dancing.",
    "gus-y2-dance": "I'm exceptionally proud of the jelly this year!",
    "gus-y3-dance": "Do try the rose hip tea, Evelyn and Caroline grew those flowers especially for it!",
    "gus-y4-dance": "We're almost at summer, @, it's almost the season for ice cream.",
    "haley-y2-dance.00": "Do you like my dress? Emily made it for me.",
    "haley-y2-dance.01": "She's so talented, isn't she?",
    "haley-y2-dance-married-other": "Just because I'm married doesn't mean I can't be the flower queen.",
    "haley-y2-dance-married-other.01": "I'm still capable of winning the crown!",
    "haley-y1-dance-spouse": "We make a striking pair, don't we? Come, @, come dance with me.",
    "haley-y2-dance-spouse": "I'll never turn down the chance to put on a pretty dress and dance a bit. Come dance with me, @?",
    "haley-y3-dance-spouse": "How do I look, my dear? Striking as always?",
    "harvey-y2-dance.00": "I wonder what's in that red jelly?",
    "harvey-y2-dance.01": "It tastes excellent, but that's...quite a vibrant red color....",
    "harvey-y1-dance-spouse": "My love, you look dashing today. Dance with me?",
    "harvey-y2-dance-spouse": "@, I'm so glad I've got you. Dance with me today?",
    "jas-y2-dance": "My collar itches.",
    "jas-y3-dance": "Look at my dress, {{title}} @! Isn't it pretty?",
    "jas-y4-dance": "I wanna dance with you guys!",
    "jodi-y2-kent": "Kent's still getting used to social events like this. We might leave a tad early.",
    "jodi-y2-dance": "Kent used to take me out dancing on Friday nights, back before we had children.",
    "jodi-y3-dance": "I wonder who Sam will dance with this year?",
    "jodi-y3-dance-sam-married": "Gosh, I didn't expect Sam to find someone so fast, but I'm glad he did.",
    "jodi-y3-dance-sam-married.00": "Marriage has been good for him, I think.",
    "jodi-y4-dance": "Kent, do you think we could dance this year?",
    "kent-y1-dance": "Everyone...everyone seems so happy. I'm...glad?",
    "kent-y2-dance": "Maybe I should ask Caroline to dance? Would be like old times again...",
    "kent-y3-dance.00": "Kent seems to be mumbling to himself.",
    "kent-y3-dance.01": "Inhale-two-three-four...exhale-two-three-four.",
    "kent-y3-dance.02": "Oh, @, I didn't see you!",
    "kent-y4-dance": "Jodi, could we please go home early? I think this still might be a bit much for me.",
    "leah-y2-dance.00": "Ah, spring is almost over!",
    "leah-y2-dance.01": "I'm looking forward to seeing what mushrooms I can forage in the summer.",
    "leah-y1-dance-spouse.00": "When I first moved here, I was so afraid no one would want to dance with me.",
    "leah-y1-dance-spouse.01": "I'm glad I have you now. Come, dance?",
    "leah-y2-dance-spouse": "You look dashing, @. Care to dance?",
    "leah-flower-dance-decline-men": "I'm sorry, @, but I'm just not interested.$s",
    "leo-y2-dance": "Parrots, too, dance with their mates. I guess we're more similar than I thought?",
    "leo-y3-dance": "Mrs. Evelyn has been working so hard on these flowers! They're lovely.",
    "leo-y4-dance": "@, do you think they'll make me go up there and dance some day?",
    "lewis-y1-dance-married": "It's almost summer, isn't it, @? What're you planning on doing on that farm of yours?",
    "lewis-y2-dance-married": "Oh, @! Are you planning on joining the dance this year?",
    "lewis-y3-dance-married": "When you first came to this village, @, I wasn't sure you'd stay. But look at you now!",
    "lewis-y2-dance-unmarried": "Are you planning on dancing this year, @? Best hurry up and ask someone quickly!",
    "lewis-y3-dance-unmarried": "Is there anyone I'd want to dance with? Errr....no, and my bum knee means I can't, anyways...",
    "lewis-y3-dance-unmarried-better": "Is there anyone I'd want to dance with? Err, yes, but unfortunately I can't. My knee, you see.",
    "lewis-y4-dance-unmarried": "Plenty a young couple first danced here on this grass over the years.",
    "lewis-y4-dance-unmarried.00": "Of course, plenty of those young couples have since moved away...",
    "linus-y2-dance": "I'm just going to sneak in and grab a bite of food after the buffet clears out a bit.",
    "linus-y3-dance": "Anyone catch your eye, @?",
    "linus-y3-dance-married": "Enjoying your time in our lovely valley, @? Are you planning on dancing this year?",
    "linus-y4-dance": "It's almost the end of spring. The weather'll start getting really hot soon...",
    "marlon-y2-dance": "You know, @, I used to enjoy a good dance or two, especially after a nice round of drinks...",
    "marlon-y3-dance": "Some say this dance is a celebration of the fertility of the valley.",
    "marlon-y4-dance": "Are you asking me if anyone caught my eye, @? Well, maybe....",
    "marnie-y1-dance-better": "I wonder, maybe this year will be the year...",
    "marnie-y1-dance-knows": "Everyone's so happy, I wish I could be happy for them.",
    "marnie-y2-dance-better": "Maybe Lewis will find some time to dance with me today?",
    "marnie-y2-dance-knows": "I...I wish we didn't have to hide.",
    "marnie-y2-dance": "Usually it doesn't bother me as much...but a day like this...I wish I...uh..I wish I wasn't single.",
    "marnie-y3-dance": "The flowers are lovely today, aren't they? Evelyn did a lovely job with them.",
    "marnie-y4-dance-better": "Sometimes, after the main dance is over, some of us older couples will dance a bit in the waning sunlight.",
    "marnie-y4-dance-knows": "Sometimes I wonder...will I ever find someone who will love me fully and completely?",
    "marnie-y4-dance": "I wonder...I wonder if anyone wants to dance with me?",
    "maru-y2-dance.00": "All right, let's get this awkward dance over with.",
    "maru-y2-dance.01": "At least the food is as good as always.",
    "maru-y3-dance.00": "*sigh*. It's almost the end of strawberry season.",
    "maru-y1-dance-spouse.00": "Gosh, this dance is going to be as awkward as ever.",
    "maru-y1-dance-spouse.01": "Everyone does look quite nice though.",
    "maru-y2-dance-spouse": "How do I look, my dear? I don't get a good opportunity to wear a dress often...",
    "pam-y2-dance": "That red jelly...that reminds me of something my Pappy used to make for us...",
    "penny-y2-dance.00": "I've been practicing this dance for weeks.",
    "penny-y2-dance.01": "I really don't want to go up there and embarrass myself.",
    "penny-y1-dance-spouse": "@, what do you think of this dress?",
    "penny-y2-dance-spouse.00": "When I was single, I was always so terrified no one would ask me to dance.",
    "penny-y2-dance-spouse.01": "Thankfully, now I've got you!",
    "robin-y2-dance": "Sebastian's not much of a dancer, I wonder if he'll dance with someone this year.",
    "robin-y3-dance": "I wonder if I can talk Demetrius into dancing with me...",
    "robin-y4-dance": "Demetrius and I try to go out dancing every Friday evening. Sometimes I have to go build something, but our date nights are very important to us.",
    "robin-y2-dance-sebastian-married": "I'm glad that Sebastian's settled down now.",
    "robin-y2-dance-sebastian-married.00": "Plus, there's a lot less pressure on him to dance now that he's taken!",
    "sam-y2-dance.00": "As much as I love the flowers, @, they don't love me back.",
    "sam-y2-dance.01": "Achoo!",
    "sam-y1-dance-spouse": "Hey, @, you look nice today.",
    "sam-y2-dance-spouse.00": "Gosh, these flowers are really triggering my allergies.",
    "sam-y2-dance-spouse.01": "Still, I'm not going to turn down a chance to dance with you.",
    "sebastian-y2-dance.00": "I really, really don't want to dance today.",
    "sebastian-y2-dance.01": "Frankly, I wouldn't if my mother didn't make me...",
    "sebastian-y1-dance-spouse": "Ah, the flower dance, my least favorite festival...",
    "sebastian-y1-dance-spouse.00": "Come, dance with me, it'll be less awkward.",
    "sebastian-y2-dance-spouse.00": "This suit itches so badly.",
    "sebastian-y2-dance-spouse.01": "At least you look great, my dear.",
    "shane-y2-dance.00": "Dancing isn't really my thing, to be honest.",
    "shane-y2-dance.01": "Guess I have to, though, it's tradition.",
    "shane-y1-dance-spouse": "I'm enjoying this festival a lot more now that I'm married.",
    "shane-y2-dance-spouse.00": "Hey, @. You're looking good today.",
    "shane-y2-dance-spouse.01": "Dance with me, my dear?",
    "vincent-y2-dance": "Miss Penny looks so pretty!",
    "vincent-y2-dance-penny-taken": "Look at this flower, {{title}} @, isn't it so pretty?",
    "vincent-y3-dance": "Do you think I'll ever become Flower Queen?",
    "vincent-y4-dance": "{{title}} @, I want some ice cream!",
    "willy-y2-dance": "This type of festival isn't usually my thing, but I'll honor the old traditions.",
    "willy-y2-dance.b": "Never was one for dancin', even when I was young.",
    "willy-y3-dance": "I wonder if there's anything interesting on that buffet table left...",
    "willy-y4-dance": "Me, dance? Well, not in a place like this, I don't think.",

    // Luau
    "abby-y2-luau.00": "Oh, @, I think I might have seen a whale!",
    "abby-y3-luau.00": "I think I'm developing a sunburn.",
    "abby-y2-luau-spouse": "Just doing a little ocean-gazing. @, I think I should come out here more often!",
    "abby-y2-luau-spouse.00": "I might be getting a sunburn, though.",
    "alex-pre-luau-unfriendly": "Hey, @. Make sure to be at the luau tomorrow. It's the best festival we do.",
    "alex-pre-luau.1": "Hey, @, am I gonna find you at the luau tomorrow?",
    "alex-pre-luau.2": "I'm so ready for the luau tomorrow, I've been doing situps all week.",
    "alex-pre-luau.3": "There's really nothing like a beach party, @. You gonna be there?",
    "alex-pre-luau.4": "I wonder what food Gus is putting together for the luau tomorrow...",
    "alex-pre-luau.0": "Heyyyy @, you gonna be at the luau? Be there, don't be square!",
    "alex-y2-luau.00": "Gosh my abs look great today, don't they, @?",
    "alex-y3-luau.00": "Heya @, wanna go hit up the dance floor later?",
    "alex-y2-luau-spouse": "Good sun, good surf, and you in my life, I couldn't ask for a better life!",
    "alex-y3-luau-spouse": "Hey, @, you wanna hit the dance floor later?$l",
    "caroline-y2-luau": "This year, I added some onion and bell pepper, always a nice base to a soup!",
    "caroline-y3-luau": "I tried to make a roux last night but burned it.",
    "caroline-y4-luau": "I bought a variety of fresh veggies for the soup this year!",
    "caroline-y4-luau.00": "Now, what does this soup need?",
    "clint-y2-luau": "Frankly, @, I'm not quite sure why the soup became a thing. I'm not sure I trust it.",
    "clint-y3-luau.00": "I'm sweating so much in this heat.$s",
    "clint-y3-luau.01": "Is this the climate change Emily keeps on talking about?",
    "clint-y4-luau": "Gus did an exceptional job on the buffet this year!",
    "demetrius-y2-luau": "The music is way too loud for our ears!",
    "demetrius-y3-luau": "Gosh, @, I've gotta get into better shape if I want to keep up with Robin.",
    "demetrius-y4-luau.00": "I'm not sure that soup is a good idea. Wouldn't that spread germs easily?",
    "demetrius-y4-luau.01": "Hopefully it's hot enough!",
    "elliott-y2-luau.00": "I'm not going to get any work done today.",
    "elliott-y2-luau.01": "It's far, far too loud for me to concentrate.",
    "elliott-y3-luau": "The fresh crab cakes really make this festival.",
    "elliott-y2-luau-spouse": "This music is quite loud. I wish they could turn it down a bit",
    "elliott-y2-luau-spouse.01": "It's giving me a headache.",
    "emily-y2-luau.00": "Isn't this party fun, @?",
    "emily-y2-luau.01": "Shout louder, I can barely hear you over the music!",
    "emily-y1-luau-spouse": "Isn't this great? I love dancing!",
    "emily-y2-luau-spouse": "Come, @, dance with me!",
    "evelyn-y2-luau": "The soup usually isn't vegan, but Gus always does a good job of making sure everyone has good options at the buffet.",
    "evelyn-y3-luau": "This loud music isn't good for my ears.",
    "evelyn-y4-luau": "Festivals like this give our little town a great sense of community!",
    "george-y2-luau": "I'd love to get a taste of that roast over there...",
    "george-y3-luau": "My wheelchair really isn't made for traversing sand. I'd love to get a better one, but, sadly, they're expensive.",
    "george-y4-luau": "This ocean is nice. Maybe I should try to get out a little more often.",
    "governor-y2-luau-joja-false": "Gosh, I don't get to visit your little town often enough.$h#$e#So, Lewis, anything new in the last year?$h#$e#I forget, what did you say your primary industry was again?",
    "governor-y3-luau-joja-false": "Ah, nothing like a nice day at the beach in a quaint small town.$h#$e#Hang on, I need to make sure my photographer gets me a picture of me eating ice cream with the locals!$h",
    "governor-y4-luau-joja-false": "Excellent, excellent. I can count on all of y'all to donate to my campaign fund, right?$h",
    "governor-y0-luau-joja-false": "Now that I'm safely re-elected, I can happily enjoy some of that roast!$h",
    "governor-y1-luau-joja-true": "This town feels like it's really industrially booming, my dear Lewis. Well done!",
    "governor-y2-luau-joja-true": "Hmmm, I haven't been back in this little town for a while.$h#$e#It feels quite different from what I remember.$h#$e#Well, I could expect some campaign contributions from all of you, right?",
    "governor-y3-luau-joja-true": "It's so hot out today, isn't it. Is this the usual climate of this town?#$e#Well, I guess I'll sample off that lovely looking buffet there!$h",
    "governor-y4-luau-joja-true": "This place seems more developed than it did when I last visited!$h",
    "governor-y0-luau-joja-true": "I must go talk to Mr. Morris. I hear he's the manager of this town's economic engine?$h",
    "gus-y2-luau": "The theme of this buffet....fresh seafood! Willy has been working overtime for a week to get me all the seafood I needed.",
    "gus-y3-luau": "The soup can be good fun, it's quite interesting to see the new flavor combinations everyone comes up with!",
    "gus-y4-luau": "Try some of these fresh crab cakes! The crabs were pulled up from the water just this morning.",
    "haley-y2-luau.00": "Maybe I should volunteer to DJ the event next year?",
    "haley-y2-luau.01": "The music they're playing...it's quite old-fashioned.",
    "haley-y2-luau-spouse": "It's quite nice, coming all the way out here for one day to catch up with everyone!",
    "haley-y3-luau-spouse": "I definitely want to get a bite of that roast over there...",
    "harvey-y2-luau": "Make sure to wear sunscreen, you don't want to get sunburned.",
    "harvey-y2-luau-spouse": "Do you want me to reapply you sunscreen?",
    "jas-y2-luau.00": "Vincent, you stepped on my foot!",
    "jas-y2-luau.01": "{{title}} @, I wanna go inside, it's hot.",
    "jas-y3-luau": "I looked at the buffet but there's nothing I want to eat.",
    "jodi-y2-luau": "I hope the music isn't going to be too much for Kent...",
    "jodi-y3-luau": "Say, @, what did you bring to put in the soup?",
    "jodi-y4-luau": "It's way too hot out today, and I'll have to put more sunscreen on Vincent soon.",
    "kent-y2-luau": "Couldn't they turn the music down a bit?",
    "kent-y3-luau": "I wanted to bring some hot peppers for the soup, but Jodi vetoed that idea.",
    "leah-y2-luau": "That buffet looks scrumptious!",
    "leah-y2-luau-spouse": "It's way too hot, @, and that music is too loud.",
    "leah-y2-luau-spouse.00": "Gosh, @, I'm starting to sound old, am I?",
    "leo-y2-luau": "This is pretty fun! I like the music.",
    "leo-y3-luau": "I like Mr. Linus. He teaches me lots, he listens to me lots.",
    // Day before the luau. True = jojamart complete.
    "luau-prelude-lewis.true.00": "We've got to be on our best behavior tomorrow, I need to get us a new grant to get Penny some more schoolbooks for the kids.",
    "luau-prelude-lewis.true.01": "With Joja here, absorbing so much commerce with such favorable tax breaks we really should not have given them, we're more dependent than ever on the goodwill of the Governor.$s",
    "luau-prelude-lewis.true.02": "Say, @, will you be at the luau tomorrow?#$b#Bring something nice for the potluck if you're coming. We've got to impress the Governor!",
    "luau-prelude-lewis.false.00": "Oh, @, are you looking forward to the luau tomorrow! It'll be interesting to see what that soup turns out like!$h",
    "luau-prelude-lewis.false.01": "Weather looks like it's shaping up nice for the luau tomorrow.#$e#You know, @, the beach is one of our little town's best assets.$h",
    "luau-prelude-lewis.false.02": "I've got so much work I still need to do for the luau tomorrow, @.#$b#It'll be great, as always.$h",
    "lewis-y2-luau": "Just to reiterate, we absolutely need to impress the governor! Hopefully, you've bought something nice for our soup.",
    "lewis-y3-luau": "Oh, @, I hope you've bought something for our little soup!",
    "lewis-y3-luau.00": "You know, this soup has been the tradition for as long as I can remember...",
    "linus-y2-luau": "Something this big needs to be cooked low and slow so the interior gets done before the outside burns.",
    "linus-y3-luau": "The heat? It doesn't really bother me, I'm used to it.",
    "marlon-y2-luau": "To be honest, I'd rather be in the mines. At least it's cool in there.",
    "marnie-y2-luau": "Hope you bought something good for the soup this year, @! Just toss it in.",
    "marnie-y3-luau": "I bought some lovely goat cheese for the soup this year. What did you bring?",
    "maru-y2-luau": "I might check out that dance floor in a bit, after I get a bite of that roast.",
    "maru-y2-luau-spouse": "It's nice to be able to check in with the town, I don't come out here nearly often enough.",
    "pam-y2-luau": "That roast does smell real good, kiddo. Might help myself to a piece of that later.",
    "penny-y2-luau": "Mayor Lewis says that if the Governor's happy with us, he might be able to swing us a grant that will let us buy more library books.",
    "penny-y2-luau.00": "I don't like having to deal with politicians but I guess I can smile and make nice for books.",
    "penny-y2-luau-spouse": "I wonder what the soup will be like this year? Hey, @, I hope you remembered to bring something for it, because I forgot.",
    "pierre-y2-luau": "Hopefully this year I'll be able to convince the Governor to lower my taxes a bit...",
    "pierre-y3-luau": "Thanks to the Governor, I've managed to secure a nice little small business grant for this year. I've got to thank the man properly.",
    "pierre-y2-luau-joja": "Pretty sure my only hope now is to get the Governor to use antitrust law against Joja...",
    "pierre-y2-luau-joja.00": "Now, if I can only get a chance to talk to the man...",
    "pierre-y3-luau-joja": "The Governor says he supports small businesses but his actions sure don't show it.",
    "robin-y2-luau": "Hey, @, you having fun?",
    "robin-y3-luau": "Oh, Demetrius, do you recognize that song?",
    "robin-y3-luau.01": "They used to play it on the radio all the time when we were young.",
    "sam-y2-luau": "I don't like this whole song and dance for the Gov.",
    "sam-y2-luau.00": "Urgh. Politics.",
    "sam-y2-luau-spouse": "Hey, @, you wanna take a dip in the ocean later?",
    "sam-y3-luau-spouse": "Just catching up with the gang for a bit. Hey, @, you checked out the buffet yet?",
    "sebastian-y2-luau": "It's way too hot out today.",
    "sebastian-y2-luau.000": "Maybe next year in a place with air conditioning?",
    "sebastian-y2-luau-spouse": "As much as I love catching up with Sam and Abby, I kinda wish we could move this inside.",
    "shane-y2-luau": "Lewis really went all out for this buffet, didn't he? Guess he wants to impress the Gov.",
    "shane-y3-luau": "Those fresh crab cakes...I'm not usually a crab cakes guy but those are to die for.",
    "shane-y1-luau-spouse": "Marnie's super worried about making that soup good but man, the buffet is where it's at.",
    "robin-y4-luau.00": "I'm not sure I put enough sunscreen on.",
    "vincent-y2-luau": "{{title}} @, can I have some ice cream please?",
    "vincent-y3-luau": "I don't want any soup.",
    "willy-y2-luau": "I put in an anchovy. Nature's MSG!",
    "willy-y3-luau": "Those speakers, it's a little too much noise for me. I can even hear it in the shop.",
    "willy-y4-luau": "Think I saw a shark out there.",

    // Trout festival
    "alex-pre-trout.y1": "Fishing? Seems boring.$h",
    "pam-pre-trout.y1.employed": "Aye! You planning on heading to the trout derby tomorrow? I'll...try to be there!",
    "pam-pre-trout.y1.unemployed": "Ugh, this place is gonna be overridden by tourists tomorrow, for that trout derby. Meanwhile, can't get our bus fixed, no, we cannot.",

    // Dance of the Moonlight Jellies
    "abby-y2-jellies": "Man, I'm not looking forward to school starting again",
    "abby-y3-jellies": "Have you ever wondered what the town would do if it rained during a festival?",
    "abby-y1-jellies-spouse": "And another summer over. @, you looking forward to fall?",
    "abby-y2-jellies-spouse": "Pumpkin pie season starts tomorrow, I can't wait!",
    "alex-y2-jellies": "Gosh, it's so peaceful, isn't it?",
    "alex-y1-jellies-spouse": "Man, I wish I remembered to eat before this festival.",
    "caroline-y2-jellies": "*Yawns*. Gosh, @, I'm getting old. I just want to go to sleep.",
    "caroline-y3-jellies": "Did you see that? Was that a moonlight jelly?",
    "caroline-y3-jellies.00": "Oh, no, I think that was just a plastic bag.",
    "clint-y2-jellies": "Glad it's gonna cool off soon, will make working the forge less miserable.",
    "demetrius-summer-end.1": "Looking forward to the Moonlight Jellies, @? They are quite striking when they gather in such density.$h",
    "demetrius-summer-end.2": "Ah, it's nearly the end of summer, I've got to start preparing for the new semester.",
    "demetrius-summer-end.3": "School year's about to begin, @. To be honest, I'm glad I don't have to teach anymore...",
    "demetrius-summer-end.4": "I'd love to go visit the deeps of the ocean some day, but money is always an issue...$s",
    "demetrius-summer-end.0": "Jellyfish only have two tissues layers, and they mostly just drift along with the currents.",
    "demetrius-jellies-pre.01": "The town gathers to celebrate the arrival of the 'Moonlight Jellies' every year, but that's really not how jellyfish work.",
    "demetrius-jellies-pre.02": "Jellies don't really control where they go, they drift along with the currents, trapping anything they can get with their tentacles.",
    "demetrius-y1-jellies": "Isn't it curious, how the currents change to bring us these jellyfish every year?",
    "demetrius-y2-jellies.01": "The 'Moonlight Jelly' rises in the water column each day near nightfall, and descends at sunrise.",
    "demetrius-y2-jellies.02": "This is known as the Diel vertical migration.",
    "demetrius-y3-jellies": "Bioluminescence is quite common among the denizens of the sea, actually. But these jellies are quite pretty.",
    "demetrius-y3-jellies-joja": "Seems like there's more and more plastic bags in the ocean.",
    "elliott-y2-jellies": "Isn't this romantic, @? This is exactly the type of place I'd pick for a setting for a romance.",
    "elliott-y3-jellies": "Between you and I, @, I'd love to turn in early tonight but there's just too much commotion on this beach for that.",
    "elliott-y1-jellies-spouse": "Isn't this romantic, my dear @? Imagine, us, the sea, a nice bottle of Stardew red...",
    "emily-y2-jellies.01": "I was watching a documentary the other day about all the interesting-looking creatures of the depths of the ocean.",
    "emily-y2-jellies.02": "It's amazing, right, what these organisms have to do to survive at such pressure and with no light.",
    "emily-y2-jellies-spouse": "Look at how ethereal those jellies look, darling! Maybe I should make a dress like that...",
    "evelyn-y2-jellies.01": "George took me on a date to the Zuzu City Aquarium once.",
    "evelyn-y2-jellies.02": "All the sea creatures were beautiful, of course, but the moon jellies were majestic.", // "moon jellies" here is intentional, that's the real-life species.
    "george-y2-jellies": "Man, I wish my wheelchair worked better on this sand...",
    "gus-y2-jellies": "I offered to cater this festival as well but Mayor Lewis said we didn't have the budget for that.",
    "haley-y2-jellies.01": "Gosh, @, aren't these moonlight jellies beautiful?",
    "haley-y2-jellies.02": "I'd love to own a dress as ethereal as that...",
    "haley-y2-jellies-spouse": "Gosh, is it the end of summer already, @? We've got to get ready for fall.",
    "harvey-y2-jellies": "Those moonlight jellies are beautiful, but you wouldn't want to get into the water with them. They sting quite a bit.",
    "harvey-y2-jellies-spouse": "It's the end of summer...@, I won't be missing this heat.",
    "jas-y2-jellies": "Oh, look, @, I think I see a tiny one!",
    "jodi-y2-jellies": "That jelly....do you think that jelly might be a rare green one?",
    "kent-y2-jellies": "I don't know about you, but I'm glad it's nearly the end of this forsaken heat.",
    "kent-y1-jellies-high-hearts": "Hey, @. You looking forward to the harvest season?",
    "leah-y2-jellies": "And yet another summer gone. Man, @, time seems to fly by sometimes, doesn't it?",
    "leah-y2-jellies-spouse": "Wow, @, yet another summer gone. You ready for fall?",
    "leo-y2-jellies": "Mr. Demetrius says the Moonlight jellies prefer warmer waters. That's why they like the island too.",
    "lewis-y2-jellies": "I'm ready to light the candle-boat any time, @. Just gotta make sure everyone who wants to come is here.",
    "linus-y1-jellies": "Oh, @, these jellies can travel all the way here from Ginger Island. Just imagine, these little creatures drifting on the ocean currents for so far...", // replacement Y1 line when the island is unlocked.
    "linus-y2-jellies": "The earth is wonderful to us, isn't she? So much beauty she provides us.",
    "marnie-y2-jellies": "I wonder if I can get Mayor Lewis to fix up the docks a little bit.",
    "maru-y2-jellies.00": "Dad talked my ear off about siphonophores the entire time we were walking down here.",
    "maru-y2-jellies.01": "Siphonophores aren't even jellyfish, but it's hard to get him to stop once he's started.",
    "maru-y1-jellies-spouse": "Ah, it's almost fall, @. I can feel the chill in the air tonight.",
    "maru-pre-jellies.00": "Dad's so excited to see the jellies again! Secretly, it's probably his favorite festival.$h",
    "maru-pre-jellies.01": "Looks like it might be chilly on the 28th, I've got to get myself a better pair of gloves if we're gonna be standing out there all night.",
    "maru-pre-jellies.02": "Maybe one year I should bring my telescope. Invite the town to take a look at the stars...",
    "pam-y2-jellies": "I forgot there wasn't food at this festival and now I'm hungry.",
    "penny-y1-jellies-spouse": "It's so peaceful out here at night, isn't it, @? Maybe I should come out here to read more often.",
    "penny-y2-jellies.00": "It's getting chilly out. I can feel fall coming around the corner...",
    "penny-y2-jellies.01": "Fall really isn't my favorite season, @.",
    "pierre-y2-jellies": "So, @, what are you planning on planting tomorrow?",
    "robin-y2-jellies": "It's time to say goodbye to summer, I guess.",
    "robin-y3-jellies": "Demetrius doesn't usually study sea life, but he sure can talk your ear off about anything if he wants.",
    "sam-y2-jellies.00": "I asked Dr. Harvey. Apparently, these jellyfish really hurt if you touch one.",
    "sam-y2-jellies.01": "Well, I'm glad I didn't push Sebastian in...",
    "sam-y1-jellies-spouse": "Man, I really should visit Sebastian and Abigail more often, shouldn't I?",
    "sebastian-y2-jellies.00": "It's so nice and quiet, isn't it, @?",
    "sebastian-y2-jellies.01": "Maybe a little too quiet...",
    "sebastian-y1-jellies-spouse": "The dock's so peaceful at night. Maybe I should come out here more often?",
    "shane-y2-jellies.00": "This festival's just so peaceful, @, isn't it?",
    "shane-y2-jellies.01": "Feel like it'd easily be my favorite festival, if there was just food.",
    "shane-y1-jellies-spouse.00": "Every year, those jellies come back. I wonder how long they've been doing this for?",
    "shane-y1-jellies-spouse.01": "I wonder how many years they'll continue coming back after we're gone?",
    "vincent-y2-jellies": "I wanna go back inside. I'm so chilly.",
    "willy-y1-jellies": "Many fish use light to lure prey to them.",
    "willy-y2-jellies": "Moonlight Jellies rise in the water column in the night. That glow...it's beautiful, isn't it?",

    // Spirit's Eve
    "abby-y2-halloween.00": "Abigail is mumbling to herself.",
    "abby-y2-halloween.01": "I must be brave. I must be brave...",
    "abby-y2-halloween-spouse": "Oh, @, I'm so glad you're here! These spiders...",
    "alex-y2-halloween.00": "Have I been here before? I think I've been here before...",
    "alex-y2-halloween.01": "No, I think that way is a dead end...",
    "alex-y1-halloween-spouse": "Oh, hey, @, you enjoying the maze too?",
    "caroline-y2-halloween": "Gosh, @, I used to love that maze so much when I was a kid. But now...I don't dare step foot into it...",
    "caroline-y3-halloween": "I swear that maze was less creepy when I was a kid...or maybe I used to be braver?",
    "clint-y2-halloween": "The maze? Nah. I'd rather stand here and enjoy Gus's cooking.",
    "demetrius-y2-halloween": "I'd love to study those skeletons a bit more closely some day...",
    "demetrius-y3-halloween": "Maybe this year will be the year I brave that maze...",
    "demetrius-y4-halloween": "Frankly, bats don't scare me at all. In fact, I find them quite adorable, and am more afraid they will go extinct.",
    "elliott-y2-halloween-spouse": "Go have fun in the maze, darling. I...I don't think that's my thing, though.",
    "elliott-y2-halloween.00": "Gosh, fall's almost over, and I feel like I've barely worked on my manuscript all season...",
    "elliott-y2-halloween.01": "The only thing scarier than that maze is writer's block.",
    "emily-y2-halloween.00": "Maybe next year we should have a pumpkin carving contest?",
    "emily-y2-halloween.01": "Or maybe we should get the kids involved? That'd be fun for them.",
    "emily-y2-halloween-spouse": "Heya @, hope you like the jack-o-lanterns I spent so much time on...",
    "evelyn-y2-halloween": "This festival...well, I'm glad the young ones like it, but do we need to have skeletons in town?",
    "evelyn-y3-halloween": "That maze...it scares me more than I should admit...",
    "george-y2-halloween": "Well, I won't say no to free crab cakes.",
    "george-y3-halloween": "Gus made fried mushrooms especially for me this year.",
    "gus-y2-halloween": "@, to be honest, those skeletons scare me a little.",
    "gus-y3-halloween": "Emily helped me make some thematically-decorated cupcakes this year.",
    "haley-y2-halloween": "Maybe next year I'll be brave enough to go in?",
    "haley-y2-halloween-spouse": "You have fun, @. I'll just...stay here.",
    "haley-y2-halloween-spouse-has-kid": "Enjoy the maze, @. I'll...just stay here with %kid1.",
    "haley-y2-halloween-spouse-has-kids": "Go have fun in that maze, @. I'll just watch the kids.",
    "harvey-y2-halloween": "Maybe this year I'll be a little braver...and get a little further into the maze...Or maybe not.",
    "harvey-y2-halloween-spouse": "Oh gosh, @, I'm glad you found me!",
    "jas-y2-halloween.00": "Auntie Marnie says I'm still too little to go into the maze.",
    "jas-y2-halloween.01": "Would you take me into the maze, {{title}} @?",
    "jas-y3-halloween": "Maybe next year Aunt Marnie will let me go into the maze...",
    "jodi-y2-halloween": "Spirit's Eve used to be Sam's favorite festival.All the candy, I guess.",
    "jodi-y3-halloween": "Gosh, @, maybe it is about time for me to start allowing Vincent into the maze...",
    "jodi-y4-halloween": "@, to be honest, I'm not sure how much I should trust this maze...something about it spooks me out.",
    "kent-y2-halloween": "Bit of a bite in the air tonight, isn't there? It'll get cold soon.",
    "kent-y3-halloween": "We're not letting Vincent into that maze, Jodi. I don't want to go in there after him.",
    "leah-y2-halloween": "Gus really outdid himself this year. The pumpkin pie is to die for!",
    "leah-y2-halloween-spouse": "You go have fun in that maze, darling. I'll just be here enjoying this blackberry cordial.",
    "leo-y2-halloween": "{{title}} @, I don't feel so good.",
    "lewis-y2-halloween.00": "This is a relatively new festival, @, but it certainly delights the younger ones!",
    "lewis-y2-halloween.01": "To be frank, I'm not sure how that maze works...",
    "lewis-y3-halloween.00": "Ready to brave that maze again this year, @?",
    "lewis-y3-halloween.01": "To be honest, I'm not sure how I got talked into allowing it...",
    "linus-y2-halloween": "The maze always delights, doesn't it?",
    "marlon-y2-halloween": "We have to freshly capture these skeletons every year.",
    "marnie-y2-halloween": "Mmmm, nothing like Gus's pumpkin pie!",
    "marnie-y3-halloween": "How sure are we that maze is safe?",
    "marnie-y3-halloween-realism": "Well, I just got done with stocking up on alfalfa for winter, I'm ready to take a break.",
    "maru-y2-halloween": "This year, this year I'll figure it out!",
    "maru-y2-halloween-spouse": "Oh, @, I'm so glad to see you...go ahead, I want to figure this out myself.",
    "pam-y2-halloween": "Mmm, nothing like a good pumpkin ale.",
    "penny-y2-halloween": "Oh, this house, this house looks so strange to me.",
    "penny-y2-halloween-spouse": "@, I'm not sure how I got here...",
    "pierre-y1-halloween": "I've got plenty of spooky goods for your to browse!",
    "pierre-y2-halloween": "Honestly, @, I'm just here to sell things. We make so much of our money at the festivals....",
    "pierre-y2-halloween-married-to-abby": "Abigail really likes this festival, I think she likes trying that maze every year.",
    "robin-y2-halloween": "Gonna start snowing again soon, @. You weatherproofed your house yet?",
    "sam-y2-halloween": "I'm so so close, I can feel it.",
    "sam-y2-halloween-spouse": "Oh, @, you found me! Let's finish this maze together.",
    "sebastian-y2-halloween": "Gosh, I feel like I've been studying this skeletons for hours and I still don't understand.",
    "sebastian-y2-halloween-spouse": "These skeletons are nicely spooky, aren't they, dear?",
    "shane-y2-halloween": "To be honest, I really don't understand this festival, but, hey, not gonna say no to free food.",
    "shane-y3-halloween": "Those skeletons are quite a sight, aren't they?",
    "shane-y2-halloween-spouse": "Go have fun in the maze, darling. I'm just gonna stay here and enjoy some free crab cakes.",
    "vincent-y2-halloween": "{{title}} @, would you take me into the maze?",
    "vincent-y3-halloween": "I'm a big boy now, I'm not scared of no maze!",

    // Stardew Fair
    "fair-prelude-lewis.00": "I still have a lot that needs setting up for the Stardew valley fair tomorrow, @, but it's going to be great! Are you going to have a booth?",
    "fair-prelude-lewis.01": "Pierre is always super serious about his booth. You think you're up to challenging him?",
    "fair-prelude-lewis.02": "Gotta make sure the Stardew Valley Fair is fun for all ages! We get quite a few tourists.",
    "abby-y2-fair": "You think Lewis will ever change up these fair games?",
    "abby-y3-fair.01": "Heya, @, think my Dad has a good shot at beating you this year?",
    "abby-y3-fair.02": "He's been working on that grange display for weeks.",
    "abby-y2-fair-spouse": "Gosh, aren't fair games supposed to be weighted against you? These are too easy!",
    "abby-y3-fair-spouse": "Mmm, I wonder what Gus's cooking up this year.",
    "abby-fair-judged-won": "Dad was so sure he'd win this year!",
    "alex-y2-fair": "I got a perfect score in the slingshot game!",
    "alex-y3-fair": "I'm gonna figure out this fishing game even if it takes me every bit of money I have.",
    "alex-y2-fair-spouse": "Let's see how good of a score I can get on the strength game this year!",
    "alex-y3-fair-spouse": "I'm gonna go eat my fill of those freshly grilled burgers!",
    "caroline-fair-judging": "May the best grange win, @!",
    "caroline-fair-judged-shorts": "Why would you do that, @?",
    "caroline-fair-judged-skipped": "There'll always be next year, right, @. I look forward to you challenging us.",
    "caroline-fair-judged-lost": "Hey, @. You put up a good fight this year.",
    "caroline-fair-judged-won": "Congratulations, @! But don't get complacent, we'll win next year.",
    "caroline-y2-fair": "We've been picking out the best veggies for weeks! Pierre's carefully studied everything that comes out of my garden.",
    "caroline-y3-fair": "Best of luck this year! May the best grange display win.",
    "caroline-y4-fair": "We've picked new cultivars for this year's fair! Hopefully these heritage blueberries score better.",
    "caroline-fair-divorced-from-abby": "This year, we'll win, I swear.",
    "clint-y2-fair.0": "These are the best swords I've produced this year.",
    "clint-y2-fair.1": "Of course, they'll be sold immediately after this...",
    "clint-y3-fair": "Every year I try to remember to learn a few new techniques for this fair, and every year I forget.",
    "demetrius-y2-fair.0": "I wonder...should I bring the poster I've been working on some year?",
    "demetrius-y2-fair.1": "I kid, I kid, I know that's not the point of this event.",
    "demetrius-y3-fair.0": "Robin and Leah both do excellent work!",
    "demetrius-y3-fair.1": "But of course, I'll always prefer my wife's carpentry.",
    "elliott-y2-fair": "Do you think I can enter a dramatic reading into the fair?",
    "elliott-y3-fair": "Ah, there's little better than good food.",
    "elliott-y2-fair-spouse": "There's something different about fair food, isn't there?",
    "elliott-y3-fair-spouse": "Gus's eggplant burgers are to die for.",
    "emily-y2-fair": "Maybe I should try to enter a dress or two into the fair some year?",
    "emily-y1-fair-spouse": "Ready for the range display? I think we'll do great!",
    "emily-y2-fair-spouse": "Darling, do you think I should enter a dress or two into the fair?",
    "evelyn-y2-fair": "Gus has been cooking the same thing year after year since he's been here, and it's delicious every time!",
    "george-y2-fair": "The one time in the year Evelyn lets me eat stuff like this, @. I'll enjoy it while it lasts.",
    "gus-y2-fair": "I don't usually enter the fair itself, I prefer just cooking for everyone!",
    "gus-y3-fair": "@, do you think I should add anything to the menu for next year?",
    "haley-y2-fair-spouse": "Our grange display is the best of them all!",
    "haley-y2-fair": "I'm not playing any of the fair games, I don't want to mess up my hair.",
    "harvey-fair-judged-shorts": "Why would you...at the fair?",
    "harvey-y2-fair-spouse.0": "Gosh, I'm really not used to having so many people around.",
    "harvey-y2-fair-spouse.1": "I'll...just be waiting for you over here, okay, my dear?",
    "harvey-y2-fair": "Gus's secret sauce even makes eggplant burgers taste better!",
    "jas-y2-fair": "Uncle Shane has been selecting the friendliest chickens for this for weeks!",
    "jas-y3-fair": "Come pet the cows, they're so friendly!",
    "jodi-y2-fair.0": "I never liked clowns, even when I was little.",
    "jodi-y2-fair.1": "Frankly, I find them more scary than funny.",
    "jodi-y3-fair.0": "Sam used to love this fair when he was young.",
    "jodi-y3-fair.1": "Might have been the funnel cakes, though.",
    "kent-y2-fair.0": "Frankly, I could do a better job than this clown...",
    "kent-y2-fair.1": "Hmmm, maybe I should talk to the Mayor about this, we could do with a little extra money.",
    "leah-y2-fair": "@, you think I should try entering a sculpture or two into the fair some year?",
    "leah-y2-fair-spouse": "@, you think we should enter a sculpture of mine into the fair sometimes?",
    "leo-y2-fair": "The burgers Gus makes are ahhh-mazing!",
    "lewis-y2-fair.0": "It's our biggest festival of the year! It's taken me weeks to set this up.",
    "lewis-y2-fair.1": "You participating in the grange display this year?",
    "lewis-y2-fair.2": "Let me know when you're ready to be judged!",
    "linus-y1-fair-high-hearts": "I'm glad, @, that you accept me for who I am.",
    "linus-y2-fair": "Ah, the Stardew Valley Fair, our yearly celebration of our lovely valley's abundance.",
    "marlon-y2-fair": "Have you had one of those burgers Gus's cooking up? His secret sauce is to die for.",
    "marlon-y3-fair": "Look at how sharp those blades are. Perfect for slicing tomatoes.",
    "marnie-y2-fair": "These are the best cheeses I've ever produced, @. I'm definitely proud of my display this year.",
    "marnie-y3-fair": "Maybe this year I'll manage to win.",
    "maru-y2-fair.0": "I can never make burgers nearly as good as Gus can.",
    "maru-y2-fair.1": "Fair food just tastes better, I don't know why.",
    "maru-y2-fair-spouse": "@, do you think I should enter a robot into the fair?",
    "pam-y2-fair": "Gotta get yourself some of those burgers Gus's cooking up, kiddo! Nothing better than fair food.",
    "pam-y3-fair": "I wish I had more time to fish sometimes.",
    "penny-y2-fair.0": "Mom thinks she should try her hand at the grange display too some day.",
    "penny-y2-fair.1": "Maybe bring some fish or something. But Mayor Lewis is no fan of ish.",
    "penny-y2-fair-spouse": "Our grange display will be the best one, I just know it.",
    "pierre-y2-fair": "May the best grange display win, @. I'm confident in mine this year.",
    "pierre-y3-fair": "I've made sure to keep the best produce we get, @. Caroline and I will have the best display this fair!",
    "robin-y2-fair": "Frankly, @, I don't have enough time normally to chat with Leah, so I'm glad these festivals exist to give everyone a break!",
    "robin-y3-fair": "I'm very proud of the woodworking I did this year. Maybe I should have entered a few pieces into the fair?",
    "sam-y2-fair.0": "Man, we used to have the best funnel cakes here.",
    "sam-y2-fair.1": "Used to be the only time of year Mom let us have funnel cakes.",
    "sam-y2-fair-spouse": "Gosh, I really should hang out with Sam and Abby more often, shouldn't I?",
    "sam-y3-fair-spouse": "Heya, @, you having fun? Think I'll go take Vincent into the fishing booth later.",
    "sebastian-y2-fair.0": "Gosh, there's so many tourists here today.",
    "sebastian-y2-fair.1": "I'm glad we don't get tourists most days of the year.",
    "sebastian-y3-fair": "I wonder if I could commission Clint for a sword modeled like the one from {{videogame}}",
    "sebastian-y2-fair-spouse": "Heya, @, also avoiding the crowds for a bit?",
    "sebastian-y3-fair-spouse": "You know, maybe I should try my hand at the slingshot game one year...",
    "shane-y2-fair": "Marnie and I pick our calmest, tamest animals for the petting zoo every year.",
    "shane-y1-fair-spouse": "Heya, @!#$e#Man, I'm looking forward to grabbing a burger from Gus later.",
    "shane-y2-fair-spouse": "Man, I'm beat.#$e#Come pet the animals, @, they're all super friendly!",
    "vincent-y2-fair": "@, will you take me into the slingshot game?",
    "vincent-y3-fair": "Let's go pet the cows!",
    "vincent-y4-fair": "How many star tokens do you have, @? Can I have some?",
    "willy-y2-fair": "I've been saving up my best fish for weeks, @! Let's see if I can beat you this year.",
    "willy-y3-fair": "We've got such great fish in this valley, don't we, @? I'm putting all my best catches in my grange display.",

    // Fishing Festival
    "abby-y2-fishing.00": "Brrr! It's freezing out today.",
    "abby-y3-fishing.00": "I can't seem to get the face to look right...",
    "abby-y2-fishing-spouse": "I feel like I've been working on this snow goon for hours...",
    "abby-y2-fishing-spouse.00": "It still doesn't look the way I want..",
    "alex-y2-fishing.00": "Fishing usually isn't my sport but maybe I should try my hand at it.",
    "alex-y3-fishing.00": "You know, @, I always wonder why we put this little pond here for this festival instead of just fishing out of the river...",
    "alex-y2-fishing-spouse": "You've got it, @, I'll be rooting for you.",
    "alex-y3-fishing-spouse": "Gosh, it's so cold today, isn't it?",
    "caroline-y2-fishing": "Fishing has never really been my thing, but I guess we've got to support the community.",
    "caroline-y3-fishing": "To be honest I'd rather be in my  greenhouse right now.",
    "clint-fishing-no-emily": "There's no buffet at this festival, isn't there?",
    "clint-y2-fishing": "It's so cold that I almost want to be back next to the forge.",
    "demetrius-y2-fishing.01": "Down south near the poles there's a species of fish that lives in sub-freezing waters.",
    "demetrius-y2-fishing.02": "Known as the icefish, they're famous for their clear blood, as they don't produce hemoglobin.",
    "demetrius-y3-fishing": "When the river freezes over, most fish just go to the bottom of the lake and reduce their metabolisms.",
    "elliott-y2-fishing": "Let's see if I can beat you this year, @!",
    "elliott-y3-fishing": "I forgot that this festival doesn't have food. Didn't eat before coming here.",
    "elliott-y2-fishing-spouse": "Let's see if either of us can beat Willy this year! I don't know, he fishes a lot!",
    "emily-y2-fishing.01": "Haley and I used to make snowmen together every time snow canceled school.",
    "emily-y2-fishing.02": "Gosh, I miss those days. Life was so much simple back then.",
    "emily-y1-fishing-spouse": "I hope we release the fish after this.",
    "emily-y2-fishing-spouse": "You're going to win this, I know it!",
    "evelyn-y2-fishing": "These igloos certainly are interesting, aren't they? I wonder who built them.",
    "evelyn-y3-fishing": "Brr! I might be too old to stand around in the cold these days.",
    "george-y2-fishing": "There isn't even food at this festival.",
    "george-y3-fishing": "Evelyn, can we go back inside? It's far too cold outside today.",
    "gus-y2-fishing": "I'd love to make a banquet for this festival too, but Lewis says there isn't the budget for that.",
    "gus-y2-fishing-joja": "Asked Lewis if there was any budget for a buffet this year, but he says no. Joja doesn't pay much in taxes, so everything is very tight.",
    "gus-y3-fishing": "Hey, @, you think I should try my hand at fishing some day?",
    "haley-y2-fishing.00": "The way the sun is striking those igloos, that's a lovely picture.",
    "haley-y2-fishing.01": "It's so cold but I guess that's what photographers have to put up with.",
    "haley-y3-fishing.00": "Gosh, that sculpture Leah's making is gorgeous, maybe I should go photograph it.",
    "haley-y2-fishing-spouse": "The way the the sun strikes the snow, it's lovely, isn't it?",
    "harvey-y2-fishing.00": "I asked Mayor Lewis once what we'd do if someone fell through the ice.",
    "harvey-y2-fishing.01": "He said we'd just pull them out, the water's not very deep.",
    "harvey-y2-fishing-spouse": "You're going to do great at the ice fishing contest, my dear!",
    "harvey-y2-fishing-spouse.00": "...but maybe after this we can go back inside and warm up a bit?",
    "jas-y2-fishing": "Can we go inside for some hot chocolate?",
    "jas-y3-fishing": "My snowman needs a scarf. {{title}} @, can I borrow yours?",
    "jas-y4-fishing": "I think this is the best snowman ever!",
    "jodi-y2-fishing": "I used to love making snowmen when I was a kid. I'm glad Vincent seems to enjoy it too.",
    "jodi-y3-fishing": "Maybe we should take walks out here more often? The air is just so crisp.",
    "jodi-y4-fishing": "Mmmm, maybe I should make some hot chocolate after this...",
    "kent-y2-fishing": "This festival is nice and peaceful, why couldn't they all be like this?",
    "kent-y3-fishing.00": "Kent seems lost in thought.",
    "kent-y3-fishing.01": "Hmmm, if I were fishing in this festival, how should I approach it?",
    "kent-y3-fishing.02": "Oh, @, I didn't see you there!",
    "kent-y4-fishing": "Should I try my hand at this ice fishing this year?",
    "leah-y2-fishing.00": "Wow, do you see what Robin's doing?",
    "leah-y2-fishing.01": "All her work is so gorgeous, sometimes I'm jealous.",
    "leah-y1-fishing-spouse.00.neutral": "I've always wanted to do some more classical art.",
    "leah-y1-fishing-spouse.00.female": "This mermaid I'm making, she's based off you, of course.",
    "leah-y1-fishing-spouse.01": "Look, doesn't she look gorgeous?",
    "leah-y2-fishing-spouse": "My fingers are freezing but I've got to finish this piece.",
    "leo-y2-fishing": "I wanna spend a night in an igloo!",
    "leo-y3-fishing": "@, do you think they'd let me fish in the festival?",
    "leo-y4-fishing": "It's warm and toasty next to this fire.",
    "lewis-y2-fishing": "To be honest I have no clue how this little fishing lake gets set up but we get to use it for this festival every year!",
    "lewis-y2-fishing.00": "Whenever you're ready, we can start!",
    "lewis-y3-fishing": "We always make sure to release the fish humanely at the end of each competition!",
    "lewis-y3-fishing.01": "So just let me know when you're ready to fish!",
    "marnie-y2-fishing": "I wonder what it'd be like to stay in one of these igloos. Seems like it could be romantic?",
    "maru-y2-fishing.00": "One year Sebastian made a snow goon.",
    "maru-y2-fishing.01": "I thought it was funny. Dad didn't.",
    "maru-y1-fishing-spouse-male": "Let's make a snowman for you, and a snowwoman for me!",
    "maru-y1-fishing-spouse-female": "Let's make a pair of snowwomen for us!",
    "maru-y1-fishing-spouse-neutral": "Let's make us a pair of snowpeople!",
    "maru-y1-fishing-kids": "Look, I'm making a little snow family!",
    "maru-y2-fishing-spouse": "Do you wanna go grab some hot chocolate after this?",
    "pam-y2-fishing": "Maybe this year I'll beat Willy at last.",
    "penny-y2-fishing.00": "I love making snowmen with the kids.",
    "penny-y2-fishing-spouse": "Hey, @, you want to help me and Jas make a snowman?",
    "pierre-y2-fishing": "I wanted to run a booth at this festival but Mayor Lewis said one booth was enough.",
    "pierre-y3-fishing": "I never had the patience to learn how to fish, sadly.",
    "pierre-y4-fishing": "Gosh, I don't know what to do with myself since I don't have anything I need to do for this festival.",
    "robin-y2-fishing": "Look at that mermaid Leah's carving. Isn't it wonderful? She always does such lovely work.",
    "robin-y3-fishing": "Maybe we should do an ice carving contest at some point?",
    "sam-y2-fishing": "Tell me, @, do you think fishing is fun? I wonder if I should pick it up.",
    "sam-y2-fishing-high": "Maybe I should pick up fishing, you and Willy make it look kinda fun!",
    "sebastian-y2-fishing.00": "I'd love to make a snow-goon but Demetrius wouldn't approve.",
    "sebastian-y1-fishing-spouse": "I wonder what's available at that shop over there...",
    "shane-y2-fishing.00": "Dang, apparently there's no budget for a buffet at this festival.",
    "shane-y2-fishing.01": "Maybe I'll go grab a pizza at the saloon later...",
    "shane-y1-fishing-spouse.00": "Hey, dear, what're you up to?",
    "shane-y1-fishing-spouse.01": "Me? I'm just slowly freezing over here, I wish Mayor Lewis would hurry up with the ice fishing bit.",
    "vincent-y2-fishing": "{{title}} @, what happens if I fall in?",
    "willy-y2-fishing": "Hey, @, you up for the fishing competition this year?",
    "willy-y3-fishing": "Some days I wonder if I should let Pam win one day. It'd mean a lot to her.",

    // winter star!
    "abby-y2-xmas.00": "I wonder who's my secret gift giver this year...",
    "abby-y3-xmas.00": "Aww, I don't think there's any more spicy tomato soup.",
    "abby-y2-xmas-spouse": "What am I grateful for...",
    "abby-y2-xmas-spouse.00": "Well, I have a lot to be grateful for...",
    "abby-y3-xmas-spouse": "Let me know when you want to go home, my dear. I think I'm done with this festival.",
    "alex-pre-xmas-unfriendly": "Wonder what you'll get for Winter Star. Maybe something fashionable for once?",
    "alex-pre-xmas.1": "Man, I can't wait to find out what I'll be getting for Winter Star this year. Hopefully, a new pair of shoes!",
    "alex-pre-xmas.2": "@, I've got to find my Winter Star a present soon...you think Joja will deliever here in time?",
    "alex-pre-xmas.3": "Emily says she's knitting Haley an entire sweater for Winter Star...#$b#That's far too much work!",
    "alex-pre-xmas.4": "Gosh, trendy shoes, or good shoes, what should I get for Winter Star...#$e#No, silly, it's not for my Winter Star partner, it's for myself!",
    "alex-pre-xmas.0": "Days like this, I'm grateful I can still spend holidays with my grandparents...",
    "alex-y2-xmas.00": "I'm grateful for my gramps and my grandma, of course!",
    "alex-y3-xmas.00": "It's almost spring, isn't it, @? You ready?",
    "alex-y2-xmas-spouse": "Winter Star is the best time for family, of course!",
    "alex-y3-xmas-spouse": "Year's almost over, @. This year was good to us, wasn't it?",
    "alex-y4-xmas-spouse": "Mmmm. Think the eggnog's stronger than I thought.",
    "caroline-y2-xmas": "The food is as good as always!",
    "caroline-y2-xmas-married-to-abby": "Hi, @! Come join us at our family table.",
    "caroline-y3-xmas": "I asked Pierre if he could just not run the stall this year, but he said that we couldn't give up the revenue that booth generates.",
    "clint-y2-xmas": "And yet another year is over and nothing has changed in my life.",
    "demetrius-y2-xmas.01": "My secret friend gave me this caffeine mug!",
    "demetrius-y2-xmas.02": "See, it has the chemical symbol for caffeine on it.",
    "demetrius-y3-xmas": "Maybe I'll get a pair of socks this year? I could do with a new pair of socks.",
    "elliott-y2-xmas": "I'm just gonna help myself to another crab cake.",
    "elliott-y3-xmas": "This is some of the best eggnog I've ever had!",
    "elliott-y2-xmas-spouse": "This type of community event...it's harder to get this in a big city.",
    "elliott-y2-xmas-spouse.00": "I do enjoy being able to catch up with the whole town on festival days like this!",
    "emily-y2-xmas.01": "Heya, @, I hope you enjoy the feast!",
    "emily-y2-xmas.02": "Gus and I have been working so hard on it, we've been up since five every day this week!",
    "emily-y1-xmas-spouse": "Gosh, @, Winter Star feels even more magical with you here.",
    "emily-y2-xmas-spouse": "I had a great year, @! Did you have a good year too?",
    "evelyn-y2-xmas.01": "Ah, another year almost over!",
    "evelyn-y2-xmas.02": "I'm glad we can have these feasts still, we still hold on to some of that small town community.",
    "evelyn-y3-xmas.01": "Come on, @, come join us.",
    "evelyn-y3-xmas.02": "After all, what's Winter Star good for if not family?",
    "george-y2-xmas": "At my age, guess I should be glad I'm still kicking...",
    "gus-pre-winter-star.0": "It's time for me to make our famous giant candy canes!",
    "gus-pre-winter-star.1": "I've got a nice roast for this year's winter star, you're gonna love it.",
    "gus-pre-winter-star.2": "Making the food for our festivals is something I quite enjoy.#$b#Of course, the money helps too!",
    "gus-pre-winter-star.3": "For dessert, I've got some lovely green jelly for this year's winter star!",
    "gus-pre-winter-star.4": "Of course, there's no Stardew festival that's complete without my fresh crab cakes. You'll get to enjoy them tomorrow!",
    "gus-y2-xmas.00": "Ah, candy making, I don't get a good opportunity to make candy most days.",
    "gus-y2-xmas.01": "To make candy canes, we have to heat up sugar syrup quite hot.",
    "gus-y2-xmas.02": "Next, we have to mix in the flavors and colors, and the white cane needs to be pulled to incorporate air.",
    "gus-y2-xmas.03": "The air is what makes the cane opaque, see?",
    "gus-y2-xmas.04": "We only have a short time to shape the candy canes before they cool too much.",
    "gus-y2-xmas.05": "It's a lot of work, but it's worth it!",
    "gus-y3.xmas.00": "When making candy canes, it's important to use an inverted sugar syrup in addition to your cane sugar.",
    "gus-y3.xmas.01": "This prevents the sugar from crystallizing.",
    "gus-y3.xmas.02": "It's also important to avoid adding your flavorings while the sugar is too hot.",
    "gus-y3.xmas.03": "Or else you burn your flavorings.",
    "haley-y2-xmas.00": "I got some really lovely silk fabric for Emily this year.",
    "haley-y2-xmas.01": "And of course I got myself a nice new camera lens.",
    "haley-y3-xmas.00": "Ah, this eggnog is much better than I thought it'd be!",
    "haley-y2-xmas-spouse": "Hey, @, I'm so glad I have you.",
    "harvey-y2-xmas.00": "Another year down, and everyone in our little town is doing well.",
    "harvey-y2-xmas.01": "That's all I can ask for, really.",
    "harvey-y2-xmas-spouse": "And yet another year down, @, with everyone in our little town well.",
    "harvey-y2-xmas-spouse.00": "I'm glad for that.",
    "jas-y2-xmas": "What're you hoping for under the tree this year, {{title}} @?",
    "jas-y3-xmas": "I wonder what Uncle Shane got for me?",
    "jas-y4-xmas": "Oh, I got a new doll!",
    "jodi-xmas-kent-return": "I'm so thankful for Kent's safe return.",
    "jodi-xmas-pre.00": "I need to prepare Winter Star gifts for the children...gonna have to shuffle around the budget a bit for this...",
    "jodi-xmas-pre.01": "Let's see....what should I get Vincent and Sam for Winter Star this year...that I didn't them last year.",
    "jodi-xmas-pre.02": "I really enjoy spoiling my kids, and there's nothing like the Winter Star season for that!",
    "jodi-xmas-pre.03": "Sam has been asking me for new video games, and Vincent new toys, but I'm not sure how we're supposed to afford all this.$s#$b#I guess we'll manage.",
    "jodi-y2-xmas": "Mmmm. Gus makes a great eggnog, doesn't he? *hic*",
